# The deploy builds in /home/deploy/cuatro-portfolio, which is also where the
# production secrets live. Without this file `COPY . .` in docker/Dockerfile
# pulls .env.production and .umami-admin into the builder layer on every build.
# The runner stage does not copy them forward, so the served image stays clean,
# but the builder layer persists in the box's image cache.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.umami-admin

.git
.gitignore
# A `.dockerignore` pattern with no slash matches at the context root only, so
# `node_modules` alone leaves `packages/*/node_modules` in the context and
# `COPY . .` drags a workspace package's pnpm symlink tree into the builder
# stage, on top of the `node_modules` the deps stage already put there.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
out
build
coverage

_bmad
_bmad-output
.bmad-loop
.claude
.vscode
docs
ops

*.md
!README.md

Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore
